sole first surfaced on the gaming  Message Board site family boards before  making the rounds on Reddit and other  social media platforms if confirmed the  tears of the Kingdom OLED motto would be  the latest limited edition console tied  to a major release a list which includes  the Pokemon scarlet and violet model  that released on November 4th and the  Splatoon 3 Model that released on August  26th those previous limited consoles did  not come bundled with their respective  games and it is unclear if this alleged  Zelda console will follow suit and in  other Nintendo leak news a new tease  popped up over the holidays pointing to  a possible Metroid Prime announcement  soon though keep in mind there have been  rumors about a remastered Trilogy for  years now so don't get your hopes too  high take this info with a grain of salt  a gaming leaks and rumors moderator  posted that a verified leaker direct  message them quote do you think everyone  is primed and ready Reddit user  spheromancer added that this same person  teased The Legend of Zelda tears of the  Kingdom title before it was officially  announced now this cryptic message could  go in a couple of different directions  for starters Metroid Prime 4 was  announced over five years ago and it's  been silent since developer Retro  Studios overtook development in early  2019. there also have been rumors for  years of a remastered Metroid Prime  Trilogy in fact gamespot's sister site  Giant Bomb reported that the original  Metroid Prime was planned to release on  Nintendo switch this past holiday season  to coincide with the game's 20th  anniversary Insider gaming speculates  that a Nintendo Direct could be on the  horizon especially considering the Zelda  OLED switch model leak but nothing  official has been announced by Nintendo  now hit the comment section let me know  what you got into over the holiday  season and if you got any cool gifts my  wife got me an espresso machine so I'm  pretty caffeinated right now I'll see  you tomorrow  foreign
 

